# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — JDK 9+/17 javac `-Xlint:all` 新增 removal 类别击穿旧项目 `-Werror` 构建 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-10-14
# Software: jtreg6 6.2+1（所有 JDK 11 时代及更早的 Java 代码基线在新 JDK 上构建通用）
# Gate: conan build() -> make/javac（-Xlint:all -Werror）
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: draft-jtreg6-6.2.1-jdk17-javac-removal-lint-werror-legacy-java-builds
title: JDK 17 的 javac `-Xlint:all` 含 removal 类别（JEP 398 将 Applet 标记 forRemoval）——
  旧 Java 基线 `-Werror` 构建直接失败；修法为 lint 列表追加 `-removal`（或钉 JDK 11 / --release 旧 API）
trigger_tool: javac
phase: build
error_signature: "warning: \\[removal\\].*has been deprecated and marked for removal|error: warnings found and -Werror specified"
severity: 2
category: java|jdk|portability|build-system
match_keywords: removal, -Xlint:all, -Werror, Applet, JEP 398, forRemoval, javac,
  JDK 17, bishengjdk, java.applet
keywords: removal lint, Xlint:all, Werror, AppletWrapper, JEP 398, forRemoval,
  jtreg 6.2, make/Defs.gmk, EXTRA_LINT_OPTS, JDK 17, BiShengJDK
approach: ①在构建脚本的 javac lint 排除列表追加 `-removal`（-Xlint:all,...-removal，
  对 `REGTEST_*_JAVAC_OPTIONS` 各条同步）；②或用 `--release 8/11` 编译旧 API 面；
  ③或钉 JDK 11 构建（无该工具链时不可行）；④避免逐条改上游源码/SuppressWarnings 污染。
root_cause: JDK 9 新增 removal lint 类别并纳入 -Xlint:all；JDK 17（JEP 398）将
  java.applet.Applet 标记 forRemoval。上游旧项目（此例 jtreg 6.2）CI 用 JDK 11
  构建不触发；OHOS 侧仅有 BiShengJDK 17，构建在 -Werror 下被新增 warning 击穿。
  属一类问题：任何含 -Xlint:all -Werror 的旧 Java 基线在新 JDK 上可能被任意新增
  forRemoval API 触发，按 error_signature 定位后统一按此修复。
rec_approach: javac-lint-exclude-removal + conandata-portability-patch
doc: 无（待 promote 后生成）

verification: jtreg 6.2+1 @ BiShengJDK 17.0.13（HarmonyOS PC aarch64）：补丁前
  AppletWrapper.java [removal] ×9 → "error: warnings found and -Werror specified"，
  othervm classes 目标失败；补丁后 clean build 通过、quick-test（HEADLESS=1）6/6、
  全量自测统计见 reports/test-report.md。
related: DRAFT-12611-jdk17-patch-build-plugin-compat（Maven 插件面）；DRAFT-12609-jakarta-cdi-api-ohos-device-java-maven-toolchain（真机通道面）；E084
